  "description": "Extra (§4.7). A lot (1,1)-(2,1), facing 1, whose building has rules [0x01018000] (test 11's rule: kind 0, side north, Car -> Car), capacity 100 and time factor 0.5. Activation: ID 1 and mode mask 2 over the lot rectangle, next ID 2, one building reference, then DoConnectionsChanged(lot). The switch phase clears the switch cells' words (no same-switch rule for east or west) and, for the north neighbour N = (1,0) with ns = SideOf(cell -> N) = 3 and a Car record, adds exit 3 to N's entries 0 and 2 (0x0808) and exits 0 and 2 to entry 3 (0x5000) on top of the piece's 0x0104: conn[1] = 0x590C; conn[2] and conn[4] keep 0x0104. Deactivation releases the building, erases the switch, zeroes both grids and rebuilds (x1-1 .. x2+1).",
